#: .\competitions\payment\forms.py:24
msgid "Avez-vous un compte bancaire professionnel ?"
msgstr "የንግድ ባንክ መለያ አለህ?"

#: .\competitions\payment\forms.py:25
msgid "Un compte bancaire vous permet d'accepter les virements bancaires."
msgstr "የባንክ አካውንት የባንክ ማስተላለፎችን ለመቀበል ይፈቅድልዎታል."

#: .\competitions\payment\forms.py:30
msgid "Pouvez-vous utiliser des liens de paiement ?"
msgstr "የክፍያ አገናኞችን መጠቀም ይችላሉ?"

#: .\competitions\payment\forms.py:36
msgid "Utilisez-vous des solutions de paiement mobile ?"
msgstr "የሞባይል ክፍያ መፍትሄዎችን ትጠቀማለህ?"

#: .\competitions\payment\forms.py:37
msgid "Orange Money, M-Pesa, MTN Mobile Money, etc."
msgstr "ብርቱካናማ ገንዘብ፣ ኤም-ፔሳ፣ ኤምቲኤን የሞባይል ገንዘብ፣ ወዘተ."

#: .\competitions\payment\forms.py:42
msgid "Utilisez-vous des portefeuilles numériques ?"
msgstr "ዲጂታል የኪስ ቦርሳዎችን ትጠቀማለህ?"

#: .\competitions\payment\forms.py:43
