msgstr "ያሉትን ደረጃዎች ለማየት መጀመሪያ ዲሲፕሊን ይምረጡ"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_form.html:199
msgid "Grades filtrés pour discipline ID"
msgstr "ለዲሲፕሊን መታወቂያ የተጣሩ ደረጃዎች"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_form.html:200
msgid "grades disponibles"
msgstr "ውጤቶች ይገኛሉ"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_form.html:224
msgid "Critères et conditions"
msgstr "መስፈርቶች እና ሁኔታዎች"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_form.html:239
msgid "Entrez les critères séparés par des virgules"
msgstr "በነጠላ ሰረዞች የተለዩትን መመዘኛዎች ያስገቡ"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_form.html:244
msgid "Nouveau critère..."
msgstr "አዲስ መስፈርት..."

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_form.html:293
msgid "Cette exigence est obligatoire pour obtenir le grade"
msgstr "ውጤቱን ለማግኘት ይህ መስፈርት ግዴታ ነው"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_form.html:326
msgid "Retour au grade"
msgstr "ወደ ማዕረግ ተመለስ"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_list.html:6
#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_list.html:70
msgid "Exigences de Grade"
msgstr "የክፍል መስፈርቶች"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_list.html:109
msgid "Rechercher une exigence..."
msgstr "መስፈርት ፈልግ..."

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_list.html:224
msgid "Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir supprimer cette exigence pour le grade"
msgstr "እርግጠኛ ነዎት ይህን የክፍል መስፈርት ማስወገድ ይፈልጋሉ?"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_list.html:249
msgid "Aucune exigence ne correspond à vos critères de recherche."
msgstr "ከእርስዎ የፍለጋ መስፈርት ጋር የሚዛመዱ ምንም መስፈርቶች የሉም።"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\requirement_list.html:251
msgid "Aucune exigence de grade n'a été définie pour le moment."
msgstr "በዚህ ጊዜ ምንም የውጤት መስፈርቶች አልተቀመጡም።"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\revoke_grade.html:5
#: .\grades\templates\grades\revoke_grade.html:103
msgid "Retirer un grade"
msgstr "ደረጃን ያስወግዱ"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\revoke_grade.html:177
msgid "Raison du retrait"
msgstr "የመውጣት ምክንያት"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\revoke_grade.html:181
msgid "Veuillez indiquer la raison pour laquelle ce grade est retiré."
msgstr "እባክዎ ይህ ደረጃ የሚነሳበትን ምክንያት ያመልክቱ።"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\revoke_grade.html:189
msgid "Je confirme vouloir retirer ce grade"
msgstr "ይህንን ደረጃ መልቀቅ እንደምፈልግ አረጋግጣለሁ።"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\revoke_grade.html:197
msgid "Rétablir le grade précédent comme grade actuel"
msgstr "የቀደመውን ደረጃ እንደ የአሁኑ ደረጃ ይመልሱ"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\revoke_grade.html:218
msgid "Confirmer le retrait du grade"
msgstr "የደረጃ መውጣቱን ያረጋግጡ"

#: .\grades\templates\grades\revoke_grade.html:238
msgid "Veuillez indiquer la raison du retrait du grade."
msgstr "እባኮትን ደረጃውን የወጣበትን ምክንያት ያመልክቱ።"

